│ {"study_index": 90, "title": "Fetal nasal bone length in euploid and aneuploid fetuses between 11 and 20 weeks\'     │
│ gestation: a prospective study", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To develop normative data for nasal bone length between 11   │
