maternal age and MSAFP, MSAFP plus hCG, and MSAFP, hCG, and unconjugated E3. RESULTS Four hundred sixty-one of the 7718 
women screened (6%) were identified as positive; 319 women chose amniocentesis, for an overall amniocentesis rate of 
