"title": "Combined use of genetic sonography and maternal serum triple‐marker screening: an effective method for 
increasing the detection of trisomy 21 in women younger than 35 years.[see comment]", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE The current
standard of practice is to screen women younger than 35 years for trisomy 21 with maternal triple-marker screening, 
