│ randomised to different screening strategies and all verified using a reference standard were also eligible for      │
│ inclusion. Studies in which test strategies were compared head‐to‐head either in the same women, or between          │
│ randomised groups were identified for inclusion in separate comparisons of test strategies. We excluded studies if   │
│ they included less than five Down\'s syndrome cases, or more than 20% of participants were not followed up.",        │
